[{"text":"FCLoopBasisFindCompletion[int, {q1, q2, ...}] determines propagators that need to be included in the loop integral int (that depends on the loop momenta q1, q2, …), to ensure that the propagators of int form a basis.","anchor":"fcloopbasisfindcompletion"},{"text":"For integrals with propagators that do not form a basis, such a completion must be found prior to processing those integrals with tools that do Integration-By-Parts (IBP) reduction (e.g. FIRE, KIRA or LiteRed). Furthermore, int may not contain linearly dependent propagators.","anchor":"fcloopbasisfindcompletion"},{"text":"Overview, FCLoopBasisIncompleteQ.","anchor":"see-also","section":"See also"},{"text":"FAD[q, {q - p + l, m}] FCLoopBasisFindCompletion[%, {q}]","anchor":"cb1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\frac{1}{q^2.\\left((l-p+q)^2-m^2\\right)}","anchor":"cb1-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\left\\{\\frac{1}{q^2.\\left((l-p+q)^2-m^2\\right)},\\{l\\cdot q\\}\\right\\}","anchor":"cb1-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"FAD[{q1, m1}, {q2, m2}] FCLoopBasisFindCompletion[%, {q1, q2}]","anchor":"cb2","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\frac{1}{\\left(\\text{q1}^2-\\text{m1}^2\\right).\\left(\\text{q2}^2-\\text{m2}^2\\right)}","anchor":"cb2-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\left\\{\\frac{1}{\\left(\\text{q1}^2-\\text{m1}^2\\right).\\left(\\text{q2}^2-\\text{m2}^2\\right)},\\{\\text{q1}\\cdot \\;\\text{q2}\\}\\right\\}","anchor":"cb2-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"FAD[q1 + p, q2 - k] SPD[q1, q2] FCLoopBasisFindCompletion[%, {q1, q2}, Method -> {FAD[{q2 + k, m}], FAD[{q1 - p, m}], SPD[p, q2], SPD[k, q1]}]","anchor":"cb3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\frac{\\text{q1}\\cdot \\;\\text{q2}}{(p+\\text{q1})^2.(\\text{q2}-k)^2}\\]","anchor":"cb3-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\left\\{\\frac{\\text{q1}\\cdot \\;\\text{q2}}{(p+\\text{q1})^2.(\\text{q2}-k)^2},\\left\\{\\frac{1}{(k+\\text{q2})^2-m^2},\\frac{1}{(\\text{q1}-p)^2-m^2},p\\cdot \\;\\text{q2},k\\cdot \\;\\text{q1}\\right\\}\\right\\}\\]","anchor":"cb3-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"Cartesian integrals are also supported.","anchor":"cb3-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"CFAD[q1, q2, {q1 - l1, m1}, {q2 - l2, m2}] FCLoopBasisFindCompletion[%, {q1, q2}]","anchor":"cb4","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\frac{1}{(\\text{q1}^2-i \\eta ).(\\text{q2}^2-i \\eta ).((\\text{q1}-\\text{l1})^2+\\text{m1}-i \\eta ).((\\text{q2}-\\text{l2})^2+\\text{m2}-i \\eta )}\\]","anchor":"cb4-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\[\\left\\{\\frac{1}{(\\text{q1}^2-i \\eta ).(\\text{q2}^2-i \\eta ).((\\text{q1}-\\text{l1})^2+\\text{m1}-i \\eta ).((\\text{q2}-\\text{l2})^2+\\text{m2}-i \\eta )},\\{\\text{l1}\\cdot \\;\\text{q2},\\text{l2}\\cdot \\;\\text{q1},\\text{q1}\\cdot \\;\\text{q2}\\}\\right\\}\\]","anchor":"cb4-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"Extending FCTopology objects","anchor":"cb4-3","section":"Examples"},{"text":"FCLoopBasisFindCompletion[FCTopology[topo, {FAD[p1], FAD[p2], FAD[p1 - q], FAD[p2 - q]}, {p1, p2}, {q}, {}, {}]]","anchor":"cb5","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\text{FCTopology}\\left(\\text{topo},\\left\\{\\frac{1}{\\text{p1}^2},\\frac{1}{\\text{p2}^2},\\frac{1}{(\\text{p1}-q)^2},\\frac{1}{(\\text{p2}-q)^2},\\frac{1}{(\\text{p1}\\cdot \\;\\text{p2}+i \\eta )}\\right\\},\\{\\text{p1},\\text{p2}\\},\\{q\\},\\{\\},\\{\\}\\right)","anchor":"cb5-1","section":"Examples"},{"text":"FCLoopBasisFindCompletion[{ FCTopology[topo1, {FAD[p1], FAD[p2], FAD[p1 - q], FAD[p2 - q]}, {p1, p2}, {q}, {}, {}], FCTopology[topo2, {FAD[p1], FAD[p2], FAD[p1 - q], FAD[p2 - p1]}, {p1, p2}, {q}, {}, {}] }]","anchor":"cb6","section":"Examples"},{"text":"\\left\\{\\text{FCTopology}\\left(\\text{topo1},\\left\\{\\frac{1}{\\text{p1}^2},\\frac{1}{\\text{p2}^2},\\frac{1}{(\\text{p1}-q)^2},\\frac{1}{(\\text{p2}-q)^2},\\frac{1}{(\\text{p1}\\cdot \\;\\text{p2}+i \\eta )}\\right\\},\\{\\text{p1},\\text{p2}\\},\\{q\\},\\{\\},\\{\\}\\right),\\text{FCTopology}\\left(\\text{topo2},\\left\\{\\frac{1}{\\text{p1}^2},\\frac{1}{\\text{p2}^2}